+"""Generated CPU probes; no checkpoint, research input, CUDA, or source edits.
+
+Run: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python -B
+  C-tests/test_model_path.py --source /exact/reviewed/work/src
